          "id": 1865639813,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "can you warning found by Scan Coverity ?\n\n```\n*** CID 1596380:  Resource leaks  (RESOURCE_LEAK)\n/builds/wireshark/wireshark/epan/dissectors/packet-http2.c: 3347 in http2_get_header_value()\n3341     http2_get_header_value(packet_info *pinfo, const gchar* name, gboolean the_other_direction)\n3342     {\n3343         gboolean override = FALSE;\n3344         const gchar* real_value = get_real_header_value(pinfo, name, the_other_direction);\n3345         const gchar* fake_value = get_fake_header_value(pinfo, name, the_other_direction, &override);\n3346         if (real_value && override == FALSE) {\n>>>     CID 1596380:  Resource leaks  (RESOURCE_LEAK)\n>>>     Variable \"fake_value\" going out of scope leaks the storage it points to.\n3347             return real_value;\n3348         } else if (fake_value) {\n3349             return fake_value;\n3350         }\n3351         return NULL;\n3352     }\n\n*** CID 1596379:  Resource leaks  (RESOURCE_LEAK)\n/builds/wireshark/wireshark/epan/dissectors/packet-http2.c: 3349 in http2_get_header_value()\n3343         gboolean override = FALSE;\n3344         const gchar* real_value = get_real_header_value(pinfo, name, the_other_direction);\n3345         const gchar* fake_value = get_fake_header_value(pinfo, name, the_other_direction, &override);\n3346         if (real_value && override == FALSE) {\n3347             return real_value;\n3348         } else if (fake_value) {\n>>>     CID 1596379:  Resource leaks  (RESOURCE_LEAK)\n>>>     Variable \"real_value\" going out of scope leaks the storage it points to.\n3349             return fake_value;\n3350         }\n3351         return NULL;\n3352     }\n3353     #else\n3354     static void\n```",
